<article class="border-l-4 border-[hsl(24,95%,53%)] pl-6">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">November 1, 2026</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Added a page at /buyer-app that shows breeders what their buyers get in the BreederHQ app, using phone screens drawn in HTML and CSS. The page is deliberately unlisted: it is noindex and nofollow, left out of the sitemap, and not linked from the navigation, footer or any other page.</p>

  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Sections</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
    <li>Eleven benefit sections: invite, Home, photos and health, Vet Report, Selection Draft, updates and go-home pickup, Products We Love, messages, invoices, agreements, and documents. Each has a short breeder benefit line and a line from the buyer's side.</li>
    <li>Breeder-led hero with the site's existing Join The Waitlist call to action, plus App Store and Google Play buttons driven by one constant in <code>src/data/storeLinks.ts</code>.</li>
    <li>Visible Photo Credits section for the Wikimedia Commons puppy photos, with author, license and file-page links.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Files</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
    <li><code>src/pages/buyer-app.astro</code>, <code>src/components/buyer-app/</code>, <code>src/styles/buyer-app.css</code>, <code>public/images/buyer-app/</code>.</li>
    <li><code>astro.config.mjs</code>: page added to the sitemap exclusion list.</li>
  </ul>
